    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/00e07f3416068d704477a3264913d6f9.avif?t=1752859916\" data-has-big width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Alive: Hollowed Horizon</strong> is a <strong>story-driven survival thriller</strong> set in the ruins of Ironhaven, a once-gleaming metropolis shattered by the <strong>Hollowborn Plague</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>2055</strong>, humanity\u2019s golden age lies in ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Haunt Cross</strong>, a cynical loner who believes he\u2019s the last human alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.poster.avif?t=1752859916\" aria-label=\"Steam-Cave-GIF1\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.webm?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.mp4?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN HOLLOWED HORIZON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan the Unknown</strong><br>Every ruin whispers. Use advanced scanning tech to uncover hidden paths, encrypted memories, and forgotten secrets buried beneath the decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Both Beautiful and Broken</strong><br>Wander through a hauntingly overgrown world reclaimed by nature. From fog-choked forests to crumbling cityscapes, every location tells a piece of the world\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the Hollowborn</strong><br>Face terrifying enemies twisted by radiation and rage. Outsmart them with stealth, gadgets, and traps, brute force won't always save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Truth Is Buried in Ashes</strong><br>Decode encrypted logs, interpret environmental clues, and survive eerie encounters as you uncover the true cause of the plague.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Choice Leaves Scars</strong><br>Your actions ripple across Ironhaven. Will you salvage what\u2019s left\u2014or finish what the plague started?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/1475c6a30c9fb8f88d9ea8f68118bacb.poster.avif?t=1752859916\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/1475c6a30c9fb8f88d9ea8f68118bacb.webm?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/1475c6a30c9fb8f88d9ea8f68118bacb.mp4?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT FROM THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Character-Driven Narrative</strong><br>Follow the uneasy alliance between Haunt and Spectre\u2014two strangers bound by survival, secrets, and betrayal. Their relationship evolves through dark humor, moral conflict, and moments of raw vulnerability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery That Unfolds Piece by Piece</strong><br>Uncover the origins of the Hollowborn Plague through fragmented logs, environmental storytelling, and strange visions. Every location holds a piece of the truth\u2014and not all of it wants to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes of Isolation, Identity, and Consequence</strong><br>Explore what it means to be human in a world that no longer is. The choices you make aren\u2019t just tactical\u2014they\u2019re emotional, personal, and permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong><br>From haunting flashbacks to high-intensity set pieces, the story is delivered through in-game events, immersive environments, and optional deep lore for those who seek it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.poster.avif?t=1752859916\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.webm?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.mp4?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plague wasn\u2019t an accident. It was a weapon.</strong><br><i>Will you cure it, control it\u2026 or become it?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/00e07f3416068d704477a3264913d6f9.avif?t=1752859916\" data-has-big width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Alive: Hollowed Horizon</strong> is a <strong>story-driven survival thriller</strong> set in the ruins of Ironhaven, a once-gleaming metropolis shattered by the <strong>Hollowborn Plague</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>2055</strong>, humanity\u2019s golden age lies in ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Haunt Cross</strong>, a cynical loner who believes he\u2019s the last human alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.poster.avif?t=1752859916\" aria-label=\"Steam-Cave-GIF1\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.webm?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.mp4?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN HOLLOWED HORIZON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan the Unknown</strong><br>Every ruin whispers. Use advanced scanning tech to uncover hidden paths, encrypted memories, and forgotten secrets buried beneath the decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Both Beautiful and Broken</strong><br>Wander through a hauntingly overgrown world reclaimed by nature. From fog-choked forests to crumbling cityscapes, every location tells a piece of the world\u2019s downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_parag