t means to be human in a world that no longer is. The choices you make aren\u2019t just tactical\u2014they\u2019re emotional, personal, and permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong><br>From haunting flashbacks to high-intensity set pieces, the story is delivered through in-game events, immersive environments, and optional deep lore for those who seek it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.poster.avif?t=1752859916\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.webm?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.mp4?t=1752859916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plague wasn\u2019t an accident. It was a weapon.</strong><br><i>Will you cure it, control it\u2026 or become it?</i></p>",
